      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "CALYPSO'S GIRL (1) did a good job to finish third last time out over 342m at this track (20.38) in a Maiden, the second top-three finish on the trot. Has good early burn and is suited drawn on the inside. Key player on best and expected to bounce back. ADHANA TORI (6) produced a moderate run last time when fourth at this track over 342m behind Mystic River (20.22). Has good early speed and can overcome the tricky draw. Likely to be about the mark. VALERIE RYU (2) had the drop on the lead and went on to be beaten 6 lengths into third (31.60) at this track in a Maiden over 530m. Good beginner aided by a nice draw. Bold showing expected. TERRIFIC BENJI (8) was a course and distance placegetter on debut and has definite claims again.",
